<title>SINGAPORE: Robinson 1st-half net profit up 20.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Robinson 1st-half net profit up 20.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 13.68 vs   11.31</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			  7.00 vs    6.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)			23.00 vs   19.00</p>
<p>    Turnover				  119.43 vs  106.35</p>
<p>    Investment income			 5.01 vs    3.68</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)		  1.54 vs    1.20</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			   18.52 vs   15.68</p>
<p>    Tax					   4.77 vs    4.35</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		 (gain)  0.31 vs    0.18 (loss)</p>
<p>    Dividend pay date:	March 31, 1997</p>
<p>    Last day books open:    March 17, 1997</p>
<p>Note - Robinson &amp; Co Ltd owns department stores.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
